{"suttaId":"tha-ap101","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5109,5124],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap101:0.3":"Veyyāvaccakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap101:1.1":"“Vipassissa bhagavato, mahāpūgagaṇo ahu;","tha-ap101:1.3":"Veyyāvaccakaro āsiṃ, sabbakiccesu vāvaṭo [byāvaṭo (sī. syā.)].","tha-ap101:2.1":"“Deyyadhammo ca me natthi, sugatassa mahesino;","tha-ap101:2.3":"Avandiṃ satthuno pāde, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap101:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, veyyāvaccaṃ akāsahaṃ;","tha-ap101:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, veyyāvaccassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap101:4.1":"“Ito ca aṭṭhame kappe, rājā āsiṃ sucintito;","tha-ap101:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap101:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap101:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā veyyāvaccako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap101:7.1":"Veyyāvaccakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2793,"to":2793,"paras":[{"para":2793,"vripara":"51","refs":["tha-ap101:1"],"lines":["So ekadivasaṃ attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>vipassissa bhagavato</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttameva.","<b>Ahosiṃ saṅkhadhamako</b>ti saṃ suṭṭhu khananto gacchatīti saṅkho, samuddajalapariyante caramāno gacchati vicaratīti attho.","Taṃ saṅkhaṃ dhamati ghosaṃ karotīti saṅkhadhamako, sohaṃ saṅkhadhamakova ahosinti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap101:1"],["tha-ap101:1"],["tha-ap101:1"],["tha-ap101:1"],["tha-ap101:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap101:1.1","vipassissa bhagavato",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
